==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*skey-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|science}}, {{m|enm|scyence}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|science}}, {{m|fro|escience}}, from {{der|en|la|scientia||knowledge}}, from {{m|la|sciens}}, the [[Appendix:Glossary#present participle|present participle]] stem of {{m|la|scire||to know}}. 

